<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About — Campus Nexus</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar" id="main-nav"></nav>
    <div class="container animate-in">
        <div class="hero">
            <div class="hero-badge">👋 Our Story</div>
            <h1>Built by Students,<br><span class="gradient-text">For Students</span></h1>
            <p>Campus Nexus started as a simple idea: why is it so hard to find the right people for a project on campus? We built the platform we always wished we had.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-cols-2 mb-4">
            <div class="card" style="padding:2.5rem; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-card), var(--bg-card-hover)); border-color:var(--border);">
                <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:1rem;color:var(--text-dark);letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Connect.</h3>
                <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.8;">We believe the best projects happen when diverse talents meet. Engineers, designers, and thinkers shouldn't be siloed in different buildings. Campus Nexus brings everyone into one digital space.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card" style="padding:2.5rem; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-card), var(--bg-card-hover)); border-color:var(--border);">
                <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:1rem;color:var(--text-dark);letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Create.</h3>
                <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.8;">Whether it's a semester project, a startup idea, or a weekend hackathon, we give you the tools to find teammates, manage applications, and launch your vision. It's time to build together.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:2rem;">
            <p style="font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.12em;color:var(--primary-light);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">The Team</p>
            <h2 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--text-dark);letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Passionate about collaboration</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-grid mb-4">
            <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon purple">🤝</div><h3>Collaboration First</h3><p>Everything we build starts with the question: "Does this make teamwork better?"</p></div>
            <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon teal">🔐</div><h3>Privacy & Trust</h3><p>Your data belongs to you. We keep your campus network secure and trusted.</p></div>
            <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon rose">🚀</div><h3>Impact Driven</h3><p>We measure our success by the projects launched on our platform. High impact, high growth.</p></div>
        </div>

        <div class="card text-center" style="padding:4rem 2rem; border:1px solid var(--border-hover); background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-card), rgba(99,102,241,0.08)); border-radius:24px;">
            <h2 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:1.85rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:1rem;color:var(--text-dark);letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Join the movement today</h2>
            <p class="text-muted mb-3" style="max-width:500px;margin:0 auto 2rem;font-size:1rem;">Don't wait for the right moment. The right people are already here waiting for you.</p>
            <a href="/register.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get Started Now →</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="/js/utils.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
